  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "What do manhwa characters do on Christmas? Curious, the brown bear editor decides to become Santa and collect the Christmas stories of manhwa main characters and present them to readers!\n\n1. **Mulmangcho Romance** (물망초 로망스, Forget-me-not Romance) \\[Hwiyo\\]\n2. **Renjeuppal Hongseoksun** (렌즈빨 홍석순) \\[Dogeumi\\]\n3. **Winter Game** (Winter Game, Winter Game) \\[Go Je-Hyeong\\]\n4. **Boricha Mat Yeoreumbanghak** (보리차 맛 여름방학) \\[Mingda\\]\n5. **Hakgyogyaedam** (학교걔담) \\[Seohu, Daengppang\\]\n6. **Saengjonilji** (생존일지) \\[Lee Ing-Gan\\]\n7. **Nae Jjakkkungeun Oegyein** (내 짝꿍은 외계인) \\[Si Myo-Il\\]\n8. **Nabiui Sangja** (나비의 상자) \\[Domino\\]\n9. **Gyeongniimul** (격리이물) \\[Park Seong-Yong\\]\n10. **Maeirui Seonmul** (매일의 선물) \\[Hanger\\]\n11. **Very Normal Ending** (베리노말엔딩, A Very Normal Ending) \\[Yu Chang-Jae\\] \n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)",
